uence, one after another. Pick two Aspects. Each brings its own Cards, and the fun is in how they mix together. Plan for Day and Night. Some Cards only play in one phase. Find Snacks and Memories. A Snack is a one-time boost. A Memory sticks with you al","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:00:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690935","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3325390-1846651706685903","game_id":"steam-3325390","kind":"update","title":"The Monster Mash Update","summary":"Check out this video which covers the core improvements in this update.This is the last update before Steam Next Fest which starts on Monday!If you haven't gotten a chance to try the demo, Monday would be an excellent time!0.9.7 (10-16-26)- Nine more enemies come alive: Buffoli, the Crunch Bunch, Werecoach, Geology Homework, Alarm Clock, Holy Roly Poly, FreeMoney.exe, Spelling Bee and Gabaghoul have full battle animations, from idle moves to attacks and flinches. The Crunch Bunch's three carrot ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T01:09:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685903","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3325390-1846018067926044","game_id":"steam-3325390","kind":"update","title":"The Movin & Groovin Update","summary":"Moving & GroovinWe finally added character animation to the game! This was a big challenge due to how our artwork is built. We don't use traditional pixels or polygons (well, they are technically pixels and polygons in the end but not at the level that matters). All our battle art is built out of tiny \"dots\".Here is the \"skeleton\" of the knight character. Each dot is colored based on which \"bone\" it is attached to. Notice how all the sword dots are orange.In order to author animations, we first ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T13:01:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926044","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3325390-1844751498224440","game_id":"steam-3325390","kind":"update","title":"The Holy Moly Update!","summary":"Introducing... the HOLY MOLY update for Slumber Realm!This update is all about JUICE. Confusing, right? We aren't talking about the apple or orange variety of juice. We are talking about the esoteric art of GAME JUICE. What makes a game feel really good? There are a huge variety of techniques game designers use to make a game POP.ScreenshakeWhite flashes on big hitsEscalating speeds and pitching SFX to create tensionHit stop (when the game slows down during a big hit)Characters squish and stretc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T12:55:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498224440","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3325390-1844115010493142","game_id":"steam-3325390","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Cloud and Juicy Animations","summary":"Head In The CloudsThe game now supports Steam Cloud! Due to some decisions I made about 3 years ago, this was not as straightforward as I would have hoped but I got there.Juicy AnimationsCheck out these improvements!Notice how the dice now arc into play when the roll button is pressed, as if thrown haphazardlyThey also bounce a few times before settlingThey squish and squash as they moveThey subtly move around in the center of the screen as if waiting for the full battle sequence to finished bef","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T19:56:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010493142","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3325390-1843481262704580","game_id":"steam-3325390","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtesters keep finding ways to break the game...","summary":"PlaytestersI don't think it's possible to make a game like Slumber Realm without the support of playtesters.Every week in the Discord server, playertesters post ridiculous things that I didn't think were possible.Like doing 33,554,433 damage in a single hit. How is that possible when her only damage card did 2 damage?They keep me on my toes and I love them for it.0.9.2 (9-14-26)- Sk8er Ability, Ollie: Yellow and Pink costs increased from 2 each to 3 each.- Sk8er Ability, Send It: Blue cost incre","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T13:22:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262704580","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3325390-1843481262692211","game_id":"steam-3325390","kind":"announcement","title":"Achievements, Sk8er Balancing, and a secret...","summary":"AchievementsAchievements are super fun when implemented well. They should do a variety of things. They should help the player learn the game initially, they should guide the player to trying a variety of content, and they should introduce interesting challenges. It was my goal in designing the achievements for Slumber Realm to do all of the above. Here are a few that I really like, either for mechanical reasons or thematic ones. Almost all the achievements are a reference to something from the 9","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T13:23:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262692211","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3325390-1842846814441664","game_id":"steam-3325390","kind":"announcement","title":"New Gamer & Sk8er Content and Rebalancing","summary":"It never stops. The demo and playtest builds have been updated!Feedback continues to arrive and we continue to work hard to address it all. Know that if you have submitted feedback somewhere, we've read it and have considered how we can make the game better based on your thoughts. We REALLY appreciate it! Keep it coming!The big changes today are a bunch of new Gamer Snacks, a new Gamer Memory, a new Sk8er Snack, and big changes to how The Sun enemy works. There was also rebalancing related to th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T22:32:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814441664","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3325390-1841579228668775","game_id":"steam-3325390","kind":"update","title":"New cards! New memories! New update is live!","summary":"The demo and playtest builds have been updated!The playtest has been running for a few weeks now and the feedback continues to roll in. For a game like this, feedback is so so so important. I get it via our Discord community, Bluesky DMs, Twitch live streams, YouTube VODs, articles, text messages, and from anonymous data the game sends me. It is all so critical and appreciated! Keep it coming!Hey Poor Player PreviewHey Poor Player was kind enough to play the playtest and write up a glowing previ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T13:32:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228668775","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3325390-1839676055895023","game_id":"steam-3325390","kind":"update","title":"First big balance update NOW LIVE!","summary":"The demo and playtest builds have been updated!The playtest has been live almost a full week and I'm overwhelmed (in both a good and bad way) by the amount and quality of feedback I'm receiving. A game like Slumber Realm lives or dies based on the efforts of playtesters. THANK YOU ALL!Here is the change log.0.8.7 (8-3-26)- Added new Neutral Memory: Garage Sale: this Memory grants 3 Gold when an Ability spends the last of a Resource.- Added new Bedroom decoration: Buffoli Stuffie.- Added new Bedr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T15:16:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055895023","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3325390-1839041357038316","game_id":"steam-3325390","kind":"announcement","title":"Slumber Realm releases Nov 4th!","summary":"Slumber Realm releases on November 4th, 2026!I started this project 4 years ago right before the birth of my son. It turns out that it takes the same amount of time to create a video game as it does a 4 year old child.My feelings about making this release date announcement includeJoyFearAnxietyWhich also happen to be the 3 emotions most people report experiencing in their dreams! I'm a mono-anxiety dreamer myself. Every dream is about packing bags and being late for an important international fl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T13:30:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357038316","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3325390-1836506165579129","game_id":"steam-3325390","kind":"announcement","title":"Watch: The Story Behind Slumber Realm’s 90s Dreamworld","summary":"Watch the new Slumber Realm interview I was recently interviewed by Wild Cockatiel Games for Building a 90s Dreamworld: The Story Behind Slumber Realm. We talked about the long road to Slumber Realm, what it’s like making games for 20 years, and how the game’s 90s dreamworld, strange childhood fears, and dice-driven combat all came together. In the interview, we dig into:Why Slumber Realm is built around a single die roll triggering your whole buildHow childhood fears, suburbia, and 90s nostalgi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-07T23:56:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165579129","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3325390-1833968530900425","game_id":"steam-3325390","kind":"announcement","title":"Play the full game early!","summary":"All the best games have one thing in common: They received a ton of feedback from players before release.Over time, I've had plenty of people play the game live with me on a Discord call and give feedback. But what the game needs now is people to go deep. I need to know what is OP, what is too weak, and what just doesn't feel right.If you are the type of person to play a roguelike for hours and have strong opinions on things like balance or enemy design, please sign up today, right on the Steam ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-02T13:11:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530900425","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3325390-1831432155578065","game_id":"steam-3325390","kind":"update","title":"Wild West Demo Update","summary":"Howdy, the Slumber Realm demo has received another big update!I'd like to introduce you to the Brain Sheriff.Ok, I'll admit this may seem totally random but there is a method to the madness. You see, your brain is what helps you regulate your emotions. The resources in Slumber Realm are emotions. And this Brain Sheriff helps you regulate your emotions by offering a trade of emotions. So, it all SORT OF makes sense! Also, Slumber Realm takes place in a dream world so it doesn't need to make sense","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T17:00:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155578065","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3325390-1828894815565196","game_id":"steam-3325390","kind":"announcement","title":"Controller Support!","summary":"Slumber Realm now supports controllers. Check out the demo to try it out. This is a first pass implementation and will improve over time.Please submit feedback to let me know how to improve it!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-06T13:03:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815565196","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3325390-1827626365762019","game_id":"steam-3325390","kind":"announcement","title":"Slumber Realm Demo Updated!","summary":"The biggest change is new character art!Here is our new main character, The Dream KnightHolding a protective pillow shield and sporting a backpack full of Equipment, the Dream Knight is ready for any Knightmare which may present itself in the Slumber Realm.For example, here is the new Mushgroom!This little guy is in love with the Knight and wants to propose something special.We also have new art for the Bureaucat.This chunky little guy is not messing around. He will assign you paperwork which wi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-22T16:56:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365762019","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3325390-1826362059918310","game_id":"steam-3325390","kind":"announcement","title":"Slumber Realm @ GDC 2026","summary":"Slumber Realm will be at the Game Developer Conference next week! The game will be demoed at the Indie Arcade Party on Tuesday night and again at the Indie BYOG Showcase on Wednesday night.Come say hi and roll some 🎲 dice 🎲 if you are in town.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-04T14:11:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059918310","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3325390-1822556746168136","game_id":"steam-3325390","kind":"announcement","title":"Slumber Realm in Steam Board Game Fest!","summary":"Slumber Realm is featured in the Steam Board Game Fest starting today!Try out the demo which was recently updated.Roll some dice.Eat some snacks.Fight a cat dressed as an office worker.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-27T00:14:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1822556746168136","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3325390-1821922921816631","game_id":"steam-3325390","kind":"announcement","title":"Slumber Realm Demo Updated!","summary":"The Slumber Realm demo has received its first big update!New equipmentNew snacksNew memoriesNew effects that looks like this:New option to trash equipment. This can be useful when your inventory is full and you want something different.The \"Skeletone\" enemy can now dazzle you with his piano skills:And dozens of other small improvements I forgot to document (in true indie style).If you play the updated demo, I'd love your feedback! You can send me a message on one of my various social media accou","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-16T17:18:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821922921816631","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3325390-1819386365111809","game_id":"steam-3325390","kind":"announcement","title":"The Escapist Names Slumber Realm One to Watch in 2026","summary":"Hey everyone 👋 We wanted to share a small but very exciting piece of news: Slumber Realm was featured in an article by The Escapist as one of the dice games to watch in 2026. Honestly, seeing Slumber Realm listed alongside so many clever, creative dice games still feels a little surreal. This project started as a cozy, slightly weird idea about dice, dreams, and late-90s vibes, and somehow it is now showing up in places we used to read for fun.Most importantly, this would not be happening withou","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-28T17:47:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365111809","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3325390":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:34Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:34Z","e